  "pr_body": "Implements ADR 0139 authoritative Editor working-copy and saved-copy coherency.\n\n- keeps existing workspace and specialized editor sessions as the single mutable owners\n- supplies immutable working-copy snapshots to Scene View, Problems validation, and Play\n- removes Material canonical autosave and makes persistence explicit through Save/Save All\n- makes Animation Set consume an open Animation Graph working copy\n- extends external-file conflict handling to Animation Set and Material working copies\n\nValidation is performed by the trusted GameEngine automation pipeline."
